# Record decisions

When you choose between real alternatives, record them as typed archive records.

```bash
archivist remember --type decision --scope repo --title "..." --body "..."
archivist remember --type rule --scope repo --severity must-not --title "..." --applies-to "internal/**" --body "..."
```

Or use the MCP `remember` tool.

- Repo: `docs/decisions/NNN-slug.md`
- Global (product): `docs/global-decisions/NNN-slug.md`
- Dev: `~/.archivist/records/`

Use front matter with `type`, `scope`, `status`, and for rules `severity` and `applies_to`.

Then `archivist index` and `archivist export`.
